{"parse": {"title": "成你本所是-03", "pageid": 139754, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-02\" title=\"成你本所是-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">成你本所是-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-04\" title=\"成你本所是-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">成你本所是</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.94.9F.E9.95.BF.E7.97.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"生长痛\">生长痛</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 生长痛</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Growing Pain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>可怜的孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欧文夫人拿出一条手帕轻点眼角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>“那个晚上”以后，偌大的缇威尔家族就散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像橡树的落叶一样飘向四方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>偷猎者被你们击退以后，我帮着幸存的缇威尔搬了家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>一些人就曾安顿在我这家小店，直到新的房子盖好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>也有人去了更远的地方，卡迪夫、都柏林、伦敦……甚至有人渡海，去了美国。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>只有你和多沃卡带着鸟儿们躲了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欧文夫人从果盘里捏起一颗山桑子，送到了小脑瓜嘴边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>我养过孩子，我知道让青少年过日复一日的生活有多难熬。我的女儿只要在家待着超过48小时，就浑身不自在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>你母亲曾说，作为一个孩子，你已经做了所有你能做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>……为什么你会觉得自己不够勇敢呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_7_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_7_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/Cg-3_7_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>……为什么你会觉得自己不够勇敢呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果我更勇敢一点，我没有被吓坏，没有被丢出战场……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我是不是就能救下他们？爸爸是不是也就不会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡收起笑意，严肃地叫了她的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你那时才十二岁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>这一切不该由你承担。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你总是这样把我排除在外！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>万一，哪怕真的只有万分之一的可能性——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果我的神秘术真的能击败那些人呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>阿德琳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫未尽的话语随着水的四散流溢而消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抿了抿嘴，后退两步，避开流到脚边的污水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她最终什么也没能说出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几息之后，她迎着渐落的日光推开果园栅栏门，头也不回地走入了林中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久无人打理，疯长的草木盖住了记忆中通向“家”的小路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凭着月光投来的方向，她在半人高的野草里艰难穿行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她撞开野草，声音像水波一般层层传递至森林的边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你在吗，格林杜尔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>月光从她身后空无一物的角落掠过，擦起一道冷色的反光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>那天晚上也是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>月亮隐身的夜晚，刮着冷冷的风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果没有神秘术的辉光，几乎什么都看不清……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我愿以……肉身为凭，求，求终得见那……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>那……未曾降生常世之灵？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩磕磕绊绊地念诵着拗口的咒文，能量从手中的桦树枝尖端倾泻而出。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术化作一串难以辨认的字符，没入了巨鸟的羽翼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如何，格林杜尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>辉光替代了月亮，短暂地将女孩兴奋的脸映得发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>契约神秘术成功了——对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>咕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它平静地抬起飞翼，垂头理了理自己被神秘术能量吹乱的羽毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩闭上眼睛，试图挡下世界中所有干扰，让感官集中于自身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她什么也没看到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咒文没有像长辈口中的传说那样，在尘酿鹰与她之间流淌。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我知道了，格林杜尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔的沉默激怒了她，面对着这只身量几乎是自己两倍高的巨鸟，阿德琳还是像气球一样鼓了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你是个小气鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我们关系这么好了，你都不肯把眼睛借给我看！我也想看看高处的风景嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>咕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>不要学小鸟叫。我是不会原谅你的，你这个铁公鸡！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她沮丧地一屁股坐在地上。格林杜尔低头看了看她，也屈腿窝了下来，让女孩能放松地躺在柔软的羽毛里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>情绪一口气宣泄出来后，她也在下一秒和巨鸟和好如初。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-533703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>是不是你嫌弃我还不够厉害？我已经熟练掌握三十二种神秘术咒文了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔喷出一下湿热的鼻息，阿德琳在一只尘酿鹰的脸上看出了“无奈”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用“火龙鳞鳞”烧掉爸爸眉毛的那天，格林杜尔也在场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>唔……好吧，“掌握”有点说大话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>但我很厉害，对不对？总有一天，我会像瑞安侬女神一样厉害！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳捏起拳头，重重挥了挥——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">“砰——”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>什么声音？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>透过树木的间隙，她看见了自地平线升起的火色光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一阵爆破声后，天际被火焰染成红色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻的大脑空白后，肾上腺素让她找回了意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>家……那是家的方向！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！快，快回去！你先赶回去，别管我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尘酿鹰没有犹豫。展翅腾空，变作一阵消失在夜幕中的疾风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩拼尽全力迈开腿，在及膝的草海中疾行，朝着晚春夜晚异样的热源奔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她还抱有一线希望。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到蔓延到庄园外的火线拦住了她的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>爸爸！妈妈！格温……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陌生人的身影让她咽下了更多的名字，更多的她视若珍宝的家人的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">外来者：</div><div>还有其他人？别想跑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩握紧了手中的桦树枝。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "成你本所是-03"}}